WEBVTT

00:15:00.646 --> 00:15:03.065
What if our buildings inspired us

00:15:03.106 --> 00:15:07.235
to want to adapt and adjust
and repair them?

00:15:07.903 --> 00:15:11.573
We can't keep knocking down
the buildings around us all the time.

00:15:12.741 --> 00:15:16.787
Let’s stop building 40-year buildings,

00:15:16.787 --> 00:15:19.790
and let's build a 1,000-year buildings.

00:15:19.831 --> 00:15:21.333
Please join me.

00:15:21.375 --> 00:15:22.501
Thank you.

00:15:22.542 --> 00:15:28.882
(Applause and cheers)